  <description>ASR6601 LPWAN SoC family with Arm China STAR-MC1 processor. ASR6601SE has 256 KiB Flash and 64 KiB SRAM; ASR6601CB has 128 KiB Flash and 16 KiB SRAM.</description>
  <licenseText>Reverse-engineered device description derived from the ASR6601 datasheet and the ASR6601 SDK register declarations. Verify undocumented behavior against target hardware.</licenseText>
